<DocsLayout title="Create your first focus" description="Turn one outcome into a Goal, Project, Task, and Highlight. Nothing is saved until you confirm the preview." section="users" next={{ href: '/users/goals-and-highlights/', label: 'Manage Goals and Tasks' }}>
  <h2 id="create-the-plan">Create the plan</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><h3>Sign in</h3><p>Sign in with Google, then open the Bee tab.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><h3>Tell Bee one outcome</h3><p>Tap Talk, describe the result you want, then tap Talk again to send. You can type instead.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><h3>Review the preview</h3><p>Edit the proposed Goal, Project, first Task, or Highlight expiry.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><h3>Confirm</h3><p>Tap <strong>Create my focus</strong>, or say or type “Yes.” Canceling creates nothing.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><h3>Complete the Highlight</h3><p>Open Hive and tap <strong>Complete Highlight</strong>, or tell Bee “I finished my Highlight.”</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="callout"><strong>Expected result</strong><p>The Highlight clears. Eligible Honey and Honeycomb Score rewards appear in your Hive.</p></div>

  <h2 id="choose-a-clear-outcome">Choose a clear outcome</h2>
  <p>Start with a result you can recognize, not a category or a list of unrelated chores.</p>
  <pre><code>“Help me prepare for my design interview next Friday.”
“I want to finish the first draft of my thesis.”</code></pre>
</DocsLayout>
